  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRS Emergency Strategy Proposal to Address Food Insecurity in Niger 2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRS will focus on emergency food security interventions to assist severely affected communities in the Ouallam, Tillabery, Tanout, and Doutchi Departments. Activities include: Cash-for-Work, targeted direct food distribution, food vouchers, supplementary feeding. CRS will also support recovery following the poor harvest in 2009 and hold seed fairs for both rain fed and off season crops. In total, 44,368 vulnerable households will be targeted</narrative>
  </description>
